Tested with mobile devices (VOLTE) :
Samsung S6 Edge, iPhone, Samsung Note4, Samsung S6

The configuration parameters, payload formats and behaviour are described at the top of
mod_amr.c; conf/vanilla/autoload_configs/amr.conf.xml lists them.

Without the opencore-amrnb library the module builds in passthrough mode: it negotiates AMR but
cannot transcode.


INSTALL

1. install the opencore-amrnb library

apt-get install libopencore-amrnb-dev libopencore-amrnb0

configure finds it with pkg-config (opencore-amrnb).

2. run make, make install

TEST

make check (needs make install first: the test loads the installed module)
